  "id": "time-score",
  "term": "time score",
  "definition": "In the b Test, a time score is one of the performance scores recorded for a person and used to compare groups. In this study, it was less useful than error scores for separating patients from malingerers because those two groups performed similarly on it, while both performed worse than controls.",
